{
  "name": "Test_Data-Extraction_Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Data Extractor Agent\n\n#### The data extraction agent, extracts from each file the key information, including:\n##### - Key parties (e.g. names, companies, shipping company)\n##### - Key numbers (e.g account number, order number)\n##### - Key dates (e.g. issue date, due date)\n##### - Main addresses (e.g. shipping address, return address, home address)\n##### - Billing breakdown (e.g. total amount, tax, unit price)\n##### - Item information (eg. item name, quantity, price)\n##### - Payment (e.g. amount paid, payment method)",
        "height": 1168,
        "width": 1680,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1648,
        1168
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "6b96b818-894b-4465-9155-455a1caff9dc",
      "name": "Sticky Note5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Orchestrator Agent\n\n#### The orchestrator analyse the user message and decides which specialised agent to call.\n\n#### There are 3 specialised agents:\n##### - Summariser\n##### - Classifier\n##### - Data Extractor\n\n##### Otherwise, the orchestrator rejects the user's request and instruct the user about the existing tasks.",
        "height": 1168,
        "width": 1632,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        1168
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "91c54ec3-f500-4552-a8e9-606ad0f099f1",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\n\nconst cleanKey = (key) => key.replace(/_/g, ' ').replace(/\\b\\w/g, c => c.toUpperCase());\n\nconst formatSection = (obj) =>\n  Object.entries(obj)\n    .filter(([_, v]) => v !== null && v !== undefined)\n    .map(([k, v]) => `- **${cleanKey(k)}:** ${v}`)\n    .join('\\n');\n\nconst formatFinancials = (obj) => {\n  return Object.entries(obj)\n    .filter(([_, v]) => v !== null && v !== undefined)\n    .map(([k, v]) => `- **${cleanKey(k)}:** &nbsp;&nbsp; ${v}`)\n    .join('\\n');\n};\n\nconst formatLineItems = (lineItems, currency = '') => {\n  const c = currency || '';\n  return lineItems.map((item, i) => {\n    const desc = item.description || 'Item';\n    const code = item.product_code ? ` *(${item.product_code})*` : '';\n    const qty = item.quantity || '-';\n    const price = item.unit_price ? `${c}${item.unit_price}` : '-';\n    const total = item.line_total ? `${c}${item.line_total}` : '-';\n    return `**${i + 1}. ${desc}**${code}\\n- Qty: ${qty} × ${price} = **${total}**`;\n  }).join('\\n\\n');\n};\n\nconst parsed = items.map(item => {\n  const text = item.json.output?.text || item.json.text || item.json.output || '';\n\n  try {\n    const cleaned = text.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();\n    const data = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n    const d = data.extracted_data || {};\n\n    let output = `## ${data.filename}\\n###### Type: ${data.document_type}\\n\\n`;\n\n    if (d.parties && Object.values(d.parties).some(v => v))\n      output += `**Parties:**\\n${formatSection(d.parties)}\\n\\n`;\n\n    if (d.dates && Object.values(d.dates).some(v => v))\n      output += `**Dates:**\\n${formatSection(d.dates)}\\n\\n`;\n\n    if (d.reference_numbers && Object.values(d.reference_numbers).some(v => v))\n      output += `**Reference Numbers:**\\n${formatSection(d.reference_numbers)}\\n\\n`;\n\n    const currency = d.financials \n  ? (Object.entries(d.financials).find(([k]) => k === 'currency')?.[1] || '')\n  : '';\n\n  if (d.financials && Object.values(d.financials).some(v => v))\n  output += `**Financials:**\\n${formatFinancials(d.financials)}\\n\\n`;\n\n  if (d.line_items && d.line_items.length)\n  output += `**Line Items:**\\n\\n${formatLineItems(d.line_items, currency)}\\n\\n`;\n\n    if (d.payment_details && Object.values(d.payment_details).some(v => v))\n      output += `**Payment Details:**\\n${formatSection(d.payment_details)}\\n\\n`;\n\n    if (data.notes)\n      output += `**Notes:** ${data.notes}`;\n\n    return output;\n\n  } catch (e) {\n    return text;\n  }\n}).join('\\n\\n---\\n\\n');\n\nreturn [{ json: { message: parsed } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
